WEBVTT

00:17.184 --> 00:21.230
-[screaming in pain]
-[Boyd] Previously on From...

00:21.313 --> 00:24.024
That thing I carried
inside me, I still feel it.

00:24.108 --> 00:25.776
[roars]

00:25.860 --> 00:27.820
Stop!

00:27.903 --> 00:29.280
I've connected
with that thing.

00:29.363 --> 00:30.865
I controlled it.

00:30.948 --> 00:33.868
I may finally have a way
that I can fight back.

00:35.619 --> 00:38.247
Her heart rate is
19 beats per minute.

00:38.330 --> 00:39.540
That's impossible.

00:39.623 --> 00:41.584
Fatima shouldn't even
be alive right now.

00:41.667 --> 00:43.544
[equipment beeping OS]

00:43.627 --> 00:44.587
Do you want to
stay here, Henry?

00:44.670 --> 00:46.672
Yes, yes.

00:46.756 --> 00:49.425
You have to forcibly disconnect.

00:49.508 --> 00:51.677
You have to
eliminate the anchor.

00:51.761 --> 00:55.264
So, the doctor wants me to
eliminate you. To kill you? No.

00:55.347 --> 00:56.599
He's not real.

00:56.682 --> 00:59.560
How could I?
Even if-- even if I wanted to.

00:59.643 --> 01:01.479
The dream is gonna provide you
with everything that you need.

01:01.562 --> 01:03.147
You just need to accept
it isn't real.

01:03.230 --> 01:04.397
How can I do that?!

01:04.482 --> 01:05.441
[gasps]

01:06.984 --> 01:08.402
[Sophia] Do you know
who I really am?

01:11.030 --> 01:12.531
[Elgin]
The girl in the background,

01:12.615 --> 01:13.949
she looks just like you.

01:14.033 --> 01:15.576
That's because it is me.

01:17.495 --> 01:19.705
We are standing right above

01:19.789 --> 01:22.041
the cavern those
bones are buried in.

01:22.124 --> 01:24.001
You wanna cut down the tree?

01:24.084 --> 01:25.544
I wanna pull it out
by the roots.

01:25.628 --> 01:29.006
Once you pull out that tree,
it's like opening a window.

01:29.089 --> 01:32.676
Talismans or not, those things
are coming inside.

01:32.759 --> 01:35.596
Whoever's in that tunnel
is gonna get slaughtered.

01:35.679 --> 01:37.473
Once the bones
are out of the ground,

01:37.556 --> 01:39.350
they'll keep
the chamber safe.

01:39.433 --> 01:40.851
And then, we get 'em out
with the ladder

01:40.935 --> 01:44.646
that they're putting
together at the, uh, diner.

01:44.729 --> 01:46.190
The Bottle Tree,
are you pulling it down?

01:46.273 --> 01:48.192
We need to make sure
that we can get our people

01:48.275 --> 01:49.276
out of the tunnels safely.

01:49.360 --> 01:51.195
No! You-- You can't do this.

01:51.277 --> 01:52.655
You can't!

01:52.738 --> 01:54.198
I'm gonna stop you!

01:54.281 --> 01:57.701
No! No! No!
I am trying to help you!

01:57.785 --> 01:59.411
-[Boyd] I know!
-I'm trying to help!

01:59.495 --> 02:01.080
It needs to be
only me and Jade.

02:01.163 --> 02:02.414
-What?
-We're the ones

02:02.498 --> 02:04.124
who failed to save
those children.

02:04.208 --> 02:05.167
Look at the talisman.

02:05.251 --> 02:06.794
Who do you think
those people are?

02:06.877 --> 02:08.963
We only get
to do this once.

02:09.045 --> 02:11.006
And I think here,
in this place,

02:11.090 --> 02:13.551
the way that
we do this matters.

02:13.634 --> 02:15.010
They're in the chamber.

02:15.094 --> 02:16.428
Let's get that truck
into position.

02:16.512 --> 02:17.721
On the next signal,
we go.

02:17.805 --> 02:19.265
[Jade straining]

02:19.348 --> 02:20.641
[gasps]
Oh, Jesus.

02:25.103 --> 02:26.188
Jade...

02:27.898 --> 02:30.109
[creature] You know, you really
shouldn't be doing that.

02:33.320 --> 02:35.614
[Jade]
No, no, Tabitha.

02:35.698 --> 02:37.031
Hey, stay with me.

02:37.116 --> 02:38.158
We're almost there.

02:39.869 --> 02:40.661
[breathing deeply]

02:42.913 --> 02:44.290
Tabitha?

02:44.373 --> 02:45.499
Here.

02:47.167 --> 02:51.171
Come on, come on,
come on, come on. Come on.

02:52.882 --> 02:54.216
Dad?

02:54.300 --> 02:56.844
Just give 'em
a moment, okay?

02:56.927 --> 02:58.512
It's just they've
been down there a while.

02:58.596 --> 02:59.680
-[Boyd] Just--
-Okay.

03:02.850 --> 03:05.811
[ominous music playing]

03:16.822 --> 03:18.324
Oh, Jesus.

03:18.407 --> 03:19.366
Don't think about
what they are.

03:19.450 --> 03:20.409
Just put them
in the bag.

03:20.492 --> 03:21.952
Okay.

03:26.165 --> 03:27.625
You guys! Come.
Get the rope ladder ready.

03:27.708 --> 03:29.084
Okay, okay.

03:29.168 --> 03:30.669
That chamber down there
becomes vulnerable

03:30.753 --> 03:33.380
as soon as that
tree starts to give. 'Kay.

03:33.464 --> 03:36.425
What's Plan B
if we can't pull the tree out?

03:36.508 --> 03:37.593
There is no Plan B.

03:39.219 --> 03:42.890
[suspenseful music playing]

03:42.973 --> 03:44.391
We should signal them
to pull the tree.

03:44.475 --> 03:45.726
Not yet.

03:45.809 --> 03:46.810
Why?

03:48.728 --> 03:50.147
Because the second
that rope ladder drops,

03:50.230 --> 03:51.774
you need to be ready
to go up with the bones.

03:56.362 --> 03:57.529
What do you mean?
What are you talking about?

03:57.613 --> 03:58.906
The bones have
to go up last!

03:58.989 --> 04:00.366
They're the only thing
protecting the chamber

04:00.449 --> 04:01.325
once the tree is out.

04:01.408 --> 04:02.159
I lied.

04:04.119 --> 04:06.330
There is nothing protecting the
chamber once the tree is out.

04:06.413 --> 04:08.540
These bones won't
stop them from coming in.

04:08.624 --> 04:10.042
What? No, no, you told me--

04:10.125 --> 04:11.293
If Boyd realized
it wasn't safe,

04:11.377 --> 04:13.337
he would've scrubbed
the whole thing.

04:13.420 --> 04:15.464
-I couldn't let that happen.
-God damn it, Jade.

04:15.547 --> 04:17.091
You need to finish this.

04:17.173 --> 04:19.843
You need to break
this fucking cycle.

04:19.927 --> 04:23.222
You go up the rope ladder
with both these bags.

04:23.305 --> 04:25.307
I promise you

04:25.391 --> 04:26.517
I will slow them down long
enough for you to get out.

04:26.600 --> 04:27.810
Jade, please don't do this.

04:27.893 --> 04:29.478
-Look--
-No.

04:29.561 --> 04:31.313
Your children
deserve to go home.

04:31.397 --> 04:33.190
[zips bag]

04:33.273 --> 04:34.316
Jade!

04:34.400 --> 04:36.276
No. No, Jade.

04:36.360 --> 04:39.488
No. Please don't do this.
Don't do this!

04:39.571 --> 04:41.365
You know,
I'm glad it was you.

04:43.575 --> 04:46.912
If I had to spend all of those
lifetimes with anyone,

04:46.996 --> 04:48.414
I'm glad it was you.

04:49.915 --> 04:51.709
[buzzing]

04:51.792 --> 04:53.460
Hey, that's it!
Start the truck! Go!

04:53.544 --> 04:55.629
Okay! Let's go!

04:57.297 --> 04:58.590
-There has to be another way!
-There isn't!

04:58.674 --> 05:00.676
[engine revving]

05:03.137 --> 05:06.932
[rumbling, dirt crumbling]

05:07.016 --> 05:08.892
[engine revving]

05:08.976 --> 05:11.103
[bottles clanking]

05:11.186 --> 05:14.857
[rumbling, dirt crumbling]

05:18.360 --> 05:20.112
Give it more!

05:20.195 --> 05:21.780
We gotta get
that thing down now! Go!

05:26.869 --> 05:28.078
Oh, Jesus.

05:28.162 --> 05:29.621
[rumbling, dirt crumbling]

05:33.917 --> 05:35.377
-Come on!
-[Boyd] Here we go. Get ready.

05:35.461 --> 05:36.837
-Come on. Come on.
-Come on.

05:42.009 --> 05:44.595
It's nice, all of us
being together again.

05:47.056 --> 05:48.348
[engine revving]

05:48.432 --> 05:52.186
[rumbling, dirt crumbling]

05:57.483 --> 06:00.527
[dirt crumbling]

06:02.654 --> 06:04.239
They can't come
into the light, Jade.

06:04.323 --> 06:05.824
They can't come into the light!

06:07.326 --> 06:09.787
[engine revving]

06:09.870 --> 06:12.039
Wait.
Grab that ladder! Come on!

06:12.122 --> 06:13.040
-[Ellis] Let's go!
-[Boyd] Hey!

06:14.625 --> 06:15.626
Tabitha!

06:15.709 --> 06:17.294
Jade!

06:22.466 --> 06:25.260
Tabitha! Jade!
You okay?

06:25.344 --> 06:26.678
Jade...

06:26.762 --> 06:28.263
Get that ladder down here!

06:28.347 --> 06:29.431
Yeah! No!

06:34.311 --> 06:36.188
Gimme that!
Give it to me!

06:36.271 --> 06:39.483
We're both
getting outta here.

06:39.566 --> 06:41.235
That's it. Got it.

06:41.318 --> 06:43.320
-Okay.
-Go. Come on.

06:43.403 --> 06:45.989
One step at a time.
Don't-- Don't look down.

06:48.659 --> 06:50.034
[Jade]
That's it. Keep going!

06:50.119 --> 06:51.453
[Boyd] Keep climbing!
Come on!

06:51.537 --> 06:54.331
You got it!
You're right there.

06:54.414 --> 06:55.290
[shouting]
Is it secure?

06:55.374 --> 06:56.707
-It's secure.
-You got it?

06:56.792 --> 06:57.668
Right,
keep climbing! Come on!

06:57.751 --> 07:00.587
[straining]

07:07.344 --> 07:09.471
[shrieks]

07:09.555 --> 07:11.223
Tabitha, whoa!

07:11.306 --> 07:12.391
Are you okay?

07:12.474 --> 07:14.518
-It's okay.
-Oh, Jade.

07:14.601 --> 07:15.769
It's all right.

07:15.853 --> 07:17.771
No! Hey! You okay?!

07:17.855 --> 07:18.897
Tabitha?!

07:18.981 --> 07:21.358
Hey! Jade!

07:21.441 --> 07:22.442
What the...?

07:35.414 --> 07:36.915
[snarling]

07:38.667 --> 07:40.002
[screeching]

07:40.085 --> 07:41.753
-[Jade] No, no. No.
-Oh, my God!

07:41.837 --> 07:43.338
What the fuck
is happening?

07:43.422 --> 07:44.715
Boyd?

07:44.798 --> 07:46.758
I have no...

07:47.885 --> 07:48.886
Oh, no!

07:48.969 --> 07:50.721
No, no! No, no, no!

07:50.804 --> 07:52.014
Oh, my God!

07:52.097 --> 07:53.182
[rumbling]

08:03.400 --> 08:04.943
Oh, my God!
[screaming]

08:05.027 --> 08:09.865
[earthquake rumbling]

08:14.286 --> 08:19.166
["Que Sera, Sera (Whatever Will
Be, Will Be)" plays]

08:23.921 --> 08:28.717
♪ When I was just a little boy ♪

08:28.800 --> 08:31.136
♪ I asked my father ♪

08:31.220 --> 08:32.721
♪ "What will I be?" ♪

08:34.932 --> 08:37.308
♪ "Will I be handsome?" ♪

08:37.392 --> 08:39.770
♪ "Will I be rich?" ♪

08:39.852 --> 08:43.649
♪ Here's what he said to me ♪

08:43.732 --> 08:46.610
♪ Que sera sera ♪

08:47.945 --> 08:51.156
♪ Whatever will be will be ♪

08:52.824 --> 08:56.995
♪ The future's not ours to see ♪

08:57.079 --> 08:59.706
♪ Que sera sera ♪

09:02.084 --> 09:04.878
♪ What will be will be ♪

09:14.513 --> 09:19.268
♪ Now I have
children of my own ♪

09:19.351 --> 09:21.687
♪ They ask their father ♪

09:21.770 --> 09:25.399
♪ "What will I be?" ♪

09:25.482 --> 09:27.901
♪ "Will I be pretty?" ♪

09:27.985 --> 09:30.320
♪ "Will I be rich?" ♪

09:30.404 --> 09:32.614
♪ I tell them tenderly ♪

09:34.283 --> 09:36.868
♪ Que sera sera ♪

09:38.453 --> 09:41.623
♪ Whatever will be will be ♪

09:43.417 --> 09:47.421
♪ The future's not ours to see ♪

09:47.504 --> 09:49.840
♪ Que sera sera ♪

09:52.634 --> 09:55.429
♪ What will be will be ♪

09:57.764 --> 10:00.559
♪ Que sera sera ♪

10:14.573 --> 10:18.827
[earthquake rumbling]

10:18.910 --> 10:20.454
Hey! Hey!

10:20.537 --> 10:22.331
Hey!

10:22.414 --> 10:24.374
Let me out! Please!

10:24.458 --> 10:26.293
Please! Please!

10:26.376 --> 10:27.919
Okay, wait, just wait!
Stop! Stop! Stop!

10:28.003 --> 10:29.004
-No!
-Hold--

10:29.087 --> 10:30.088
-No!
-You're safe here!

10:30.172 --> 10:32.716
What is-- What's happening?

10:32.799 --> 10:33.884
I know, I know!

10:33.967 --> 10:35.552
I told you not to
pull down the tree!

10:35.635 --> 10:36.928
Why didn't you listen?

10:37.012 --> 10:40.432
[earthquake rumbling]

10:42.601 --> 10:44.853
[screams]

10:44.936 --> 10:48.231
[breathing heavily]
Oh! Oh, Jesus.

10:48.315 --> 10:50.400
Oh, no.

10:52.277 --> 10:55.197
Oh, no, no.
No, no, no.

10:55.280 --> 10:56.615
Jade!
Jade, over there! Come on.

10:56.698 --> 10:58.033
Son of a bitch!

10:58.116 --> 10:59.409
[Tabitha] Let's go!

10:59.493 --> 11:01.495
Come on, come on, let's go!
Let's go!

11:08.293 --> 11:10.170
Tabitha?! Jade?!

11:10.253 --> 11:12.464
[creature screeching]

11:12.547 --> 11:13.924
We can't be out
in the open like this, man.

11:14.007 --> 11:16.134
Tabitha!

11:16.218 --> 11:17.636
I'm gonna need you to answer.

11:17.719 --> 11:20.055
[creature screeching]

11:20.138 --> 11:23.975
Jade?! Tabitha,
I need you to talk to me!

11:24.059 --> 11:26.186
-Boyd, we gotta go.
-Get the chain from the truck.

11:26.269 --> 11:27.521
-What?
-I'm going down there.

11:27.604 --> 11:29.523
-You can't go down there.
-Get the fucking chain!

11:29.606 --> 11:31.274
-No!
-No, no, we need to go.

11:31.358 --> 11:32.692
-Please, we need to go now!
-Boyd!

11:32.776 --> 11:34.569
I am not losing them.

11:34.653 --> 11:36.446
If we don't leave now,
we're gonna lose everybody.

11:36.530 --> 11:37.656
[creature screeching]

11:37.739 --> 11:39.699
[creatures screeching]

11:39.783 --> 11:40.909
-Dad!
-We gotta go!

11:40.992 --> 11:44.079
-Boyd!
-[creatures screeching]

11:44.162 --> 11:45.038
[creatures screeching]

11:49.084 --> 11:50.377
[Ellis] Dad?

11:50.460 --> 11:51.294
-[Boyd] Fuck!
-Boyd!

11:51.378 --> 11:52.462
Dad!

11:52.546 --> 11:54.089
Everybody into
the vehicles! Now!

11:54.172 --> 11:57.217
Go, go, go, come on! Go!
All right, let's go!

11:57.300 --> 11:59.177
Randall, help me get
the chain off the truck!

11:59.261 --> 12:00.971
-Come on!
-[hyperventilating]

12:01.054 --> 12:03.181
[indistinct shouting]

12:03.265 --> 12:04.391
[Acosta]
Get in the van now!

12:04.474 --> 12:06.476
It's okay, it's okay!

12:06.560 --> 12:07.686
It's okay, Patty! Patty!

12:07.769 --> 12:08.645
-No!
-[shot firing]

12:10.188 --> 12:12.232
-Get in!
-[Acosta] Boyd, come on!

12:12.315 --> 12:14.818
-[shots firing]
-In! Let's go! Come on!

12:14.901 --> 12:16.153
[Acosta] Kristi! Let's go!

12:16.236 --> 12:17.571
-Come on...
-Get in!

12:17.654 --> 12:19.531
-[yelps] No! No!
-It's okay! It's okay!

12:19.614 --> 12:21.324
-[Patty sobs]
-[shouting]

12:21.408 --> 12:23.201
-No, no, no! Go! Go!
-[Acosta] Let's go!

12:23.285 --> 12:25.370
-Let's get out of here! Go!
-[Randall] Come on!

12:34.337 --> 12:35.338
[Tabitha] Come on, Jade.

12:37.924 --> 12:39.301
-Okay, come!
-[creatures screeching]

12:39.384 --> 12:40.302
Jade!

12:40.385 --> 12:41.553
Keep going!

12:41.636 --> 12:43.221
[Tabitha]
Oh, God!

12:43.305 --> 12:46.391
[creatures screeching]

12:46.475 --> 12:48.852
[Jade]
Keep going! Keep going!

12:48.935 --> 12:50.020
[snarling]

12:50.103 --> 12:54.149
[screeching]

12:54.232 --> 12:55.609
[gasping]

12:55.692 --> 12:57.360
Keep going.

12:57.444 --> 12:58.695
Go! Go, go, go, go!

12:58.778 --> 13:00.906
-[gasps]
-Keep going.

13:00.989 --> 13:01.948
[Tabitha] Oh, my God.

13:02.032 --> 13:03.283
No.

13:06.453 --> 13:07.454
Jade!

13:10.332 --> 13:11.333
[Jade] Oh, God!

13:11.416 --> 13:13.335
No! God damn it!

13:13.418 --> 13:15.420
[creatures screeching]

13:15.504 --> 13:16.671
[Tabitha]
Oh, my God!

13:16.755 --> 13:17.631
Fuck!

13:19.174 --> 13:23.762
[creatures snarling]

13:23.845 --> 13:25.639
[screeching]

13:25.722 --> 13:27.641
[rumbling]

13:27.724 --> 13:28.683
[screeching]

13:28.767 --> 13:33.605
[rumbling]

13:39.986 --> 13:41.821
[Patty] Hurry up! Hurry up!

13:41.905 --> 13:43.907
They're coming!
Hurry up, please!

13:43.990 --> 13:45.617
Hurry up! Hurry up!

13:45.700 --> 13:47.536
Boyd, you better shut her
the fuck up back there!

13:47.619 --> 13:49.663
[Boyd] Okay.
Hey, look, everybody, easy.

13:49.746 --> 13:51.081
You're okay. Take it easy.

13:51.164 --> 13:53.750
Listen, take--
take deep breaths, all right?

13:53.833 --> 13:55.252
Take deep breaths.

13:55.335 --> 13:56.670
You're gonna--
we're almost back to town.

13:56.753 --> 13:58.171
We are--

13:58.255 --> 14:00.090
It doesn't matter!
We made things worse.

14:00.173 --> 14:02.759
We made this place angry!
Now, we're gonna be punished.

14:02.842 --> 14:04.010
-[screeching in distance]
-Listen to me!

14:04.094 --> 14:05.595
We are going to be fine!

14:05.679 --> 14:06.763
You are a liar!

14:06.846 --> 14:07.889
You promised we'd go home!

14:07.973 --> 14:09.099
Patty!

14:09.182 --> 14:11.059
I can't!
I can't do this.

14:11.142 --> 14:13.395
I don't wanna
be here anymore.

14:13.478 --> 14:15.105
-[Bakta] Look out!
-Oh, what the fuck!

14:15.188 --> 14:16.940
[screeching]

14:17.023 --> 14:19.025
[passengers screaming]

14:19.109 --> 14:20.735
[screeching]

14:20.819 --> 14:21.570
What the fuck!

14:21.653 --> 14:26.032
[creature screeching]

14:26.116 --> 14:27.450
Hey, hey, you good?

14:30.036 --> 14:31.580
No, no, no, no! Patty!

14:31.663 --> 14:32.789
What the fuck?!
What the fuck?!

14:32.872 --> 14:35.208
What the fuck
is wrong with you?! Huh?

14:35.292 --> 14:36.793
-Are you fucking--
-[sobbing]

14:36.876 --> 14:38.211
It's okay.

14:38.295 --> 14:41.131
Oh, shit, shit!
Ahh! Keep going!

14:41.214 --> 14:43.758
-[Acosta] Okay! I'm going!
-[sobbing]

14:43.842 --> 14:45.802
Just sit down!
Keep going!

14:45.885 --> 14:46.970
[Acosta] Okay!

14:47.053 --> 14:48.638
-It's okay.
-[Patty sobbing]

14:48.722 --> 14:50.056
It's okay. We're okay,
we're okay, we're okay.

14:51.808 --> 14:54.436
Look,
we need to do something.

14:54.519 --> 14:56.771
[Marielle]
We need to wait.

14:56.855 --> 14:58.815
And what happens
if they don't come back?

14:58.898 --> 15:00.525
They're out there,
right now, in the woods.

15:00.609 --> 15:02.569
You want to run outside
and get yourself killed?

15:02.652 --> 15:04.154
Would that make
you feel better?

15:07.907 --> 15:09.409
How are you so calm?

15:13.079 --> 15:15.123
I'm not. 'Kay?

15:15.206 --> 15:17.667
But right now, it is our job
to hold our shit together.

15:17.751 --> 15:19.461
No. Fuck that.

15:21.212 --> 15:23.965
Wait. Fatima. Wait.
Hey, stop!

15:24.049 --> 15:25.842
You are in no shape to
go out there right now. Please!

15:25.925 --> 15:27.802
What shape am I in?

15:27.886 --> 15:30.138
You and Kristi have had me here
this whole time, doing puzzles.

15:30.221 --> 15:31.514
What's wrong with me?

15:31.598 --> 15:33.350
What are you not telling me?

15:33.433 --> 15:34.851
God, why won't you--

15:38.980 --> 15:40.190
[Marielle] Fatima?

15:40.273 --> 15:43.026
Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no.

15:43.109 --> 15:44.444
Hey, what's going on?

15:44.527 --> 15:46.112
[breathing shakily]

15:49.949 --> 15:51.534
Fatima?

15:51.618 --> 15:53.411
He's coming.

15:59.751 --> 16:01.503
That thing I gave birth to,
it's coming to the clinic.

16:09.344 --> 16:12.222
It's okay. We're okay.
He can't get inside.

16:12.305 --> 16:13.682
We have--

16:13.765 --> 16:15.225
Oh, shit.

16:15.308 --> 16:16.518
Where is the talisman?

16:16.601 --> 16:18.603
The quake must have
knocked it off the wall.

16:18.687 --> 16:20.605
Where the fuck
is the talisman? Where's...?

16:20.689 --> 16:21.648
-Marielle!
-There!

16:21.731 --> 16:22.816
[Fatima] Okay, get it, get it!

16:22.899 --> 16:23.858
Oh!

16:26.319 --> 16:27.237
Marielle!

16:27.320 --> 16:28.905
Come on! Come on!

16:28.988 --> 16:30.031
Hurry!

16:30.115 --> 16:31.366
[straining]

16:31.449 --> 16:32.867
Marielle! Marielle! Marielle!

16:32.951 --> 16:34.119
Got it!

16:34.202 --> 16:35.787
[screaming]

16:35.870 --> 16:37.580
Come on! In here!

16:42.419 --> 16:44.629
-Hang the talisman with this!
-Hurry!

16:47.799 --> 16:49.300
[screaming]

16:51.803 --> 16:52.637
Mother.

16:57.726 --> 16:58.935
Get the fuck out!

16:59.018 --> 17:00.603
[shrieks]

17:00.687 --> 17:01.563
Stop!

17:03.314 --> 17:05.900
[shrieks]

17:05.983 --> 17:07.569
[both shrieking]

17:10.488 --> 17:12.198
[Fatima shrieking]

17:12.281 --> 17:14.576
[gasping]

17:17.871 --> 17:19.414
Interesting.

17:19.497 --> 17:23.292
[Marielle gasping]

17:25.837 --> 17:29.758
[gasping]

17:29.841 --> 17:31.259
Stay away from me!

17:31.342 --> 17:32.552
No! Please,
I'm not gonna hurt you.

17:32.635 --> 17:34.429
Tell me how to help you.

17:34.512 --> 17:36.514
I'm okay.

17:36.598 --> 17:37.599
I'll be okay.

17:37.682 --> 17:39.309
Here.
Marielle, what do I do?

17:39.392 --> 17:40.935
Tell me what to do!

17:41.019 --> 17:42.645
Where's Kristi?
I need to see Kristi.

17:42.729 --> 17:44.022
I know, I know.

17:54.908 --> 17:56.493
No. Wait.

17:56.576 --> 17:58.411
No. What's that?

17:59.913 --> 18:01.331
-No fucking way.
-Oh, shit.

18:01.414 --> 18:02.373
No, go.

18:02.457 --> 18:03.708
[Ellis] Shit, shit, shit.

18:03.792 --> 18:04.793
-Okay. Come on.
-Go!

18:09.380 --> 18:11.132
Everyone inside!

18:11.216 --> 18:12.509
Inside!

18:12.592 --> 18:14.511
No, no, no, no, no, no!

18:14.594 --> 18:15.720
Go!

18:15.804 --> 18:16.888
-Mari!
-[Fatima] In here!

18:19.849 --> 18:21.893
[shudders]

18:23.353 --> 18:24.437
Baby, hey. Baby.

18:24.521 --> 18:26.064
I'm-- I'm sorry.

18:26.147 --> 18:27.440
You don't have to be sorry.

18:27.524 --> 18:28.858
You're gonna be okay. Okay?

18:28.942 --> 18:29.901
Hey. What do you need?

18:29.984 --> 18:31.152
My bag.
It's in the lobby.

18:31.236 --> 18:32.362
Okay.

18:34.072 --> 18:36.407
I need you to
stay with me, okay?

18:36.491 --> 18:37.951
It's bad, Kristi.

18:38.034 --> 18:39.744
[shushing]

18:39.828 --> 18:41.704
I don't wanna go--

18:41.788 --> 18:43.248
[shushing]
Hey, hey.

18:43.331 --> 18:44.999
I just need you to focus on me,
okay? Just focus on me.

18:45.083 --> 18:46.918
I love you so much.

18:47.001 --> 18:48.837
Mari, please.

18:48.920 --> 18:50.213
Will you kiss me goodbye?

18:50.296 --> 18:52.173
Please?

18:52.257 --> 18:54.259
I need to kiss you
goodbye, please.

18:54.342 --> 18:56.761
[breathing shakily]

19:02.267 --> 19:03.560
[sobbing]

19:09.607 --> 19:12.485
No. No.

19:12.569 --> 19:17.407
[sobbing]

19:19.117 --> 19:20.994
No. I love you.

19:23.037 --> 19:25.456
I love you!

19:25.540 --> 19:27.917
I love you!
[sobbing]

19:28.001 --> 19:30.879
[sobbing]
I love you!

19:34.173 --> 19:36.509
Elgin, do you understand
what I'm offering you?

19:38.469 --> 19:41.472
It's a chance to go home,

19:41.556 --> 19:44.183
to leave all
of this behind you,

19:45.685 --> 19:47.687
just like I did for Clara.

19:50.690 --> 19:53.276
Pretty soon, this would
all feel like a bad dream

19:53.359 --> 19:57.363
that fades a little more
with each passing day.

19:57.447 --> 19:59.032
And all you would
have to do is help me.

20:02.827 --> 20:04.078
Elgin?

20:06.331 --> 20:07.165
I understand.

20:07.248 --> 20:08.291
And?

20:09.751 --> 20:12.337
[breathes rapidly]

20:12.420 --> 20:14.672
Don't look at her.

20:14.756 --> 20:16.174
Look at me.

20:27.518 --> 20:28.895
[breathes deeply]

20:30.855 --> 20:33.066
Do you know why
it's dark outside?

20:35.234 --> 20:37.320
It's because we're
getting close to the end.

20:39.822 --> 20:41.658
It gets very
messy at the end.

20:43.284 --> 20:44.577
I'm trying to
spare you from that.

20:46.955 --> 20:48.122
Elgin.

20:51.542 --> 20:52.752
Honestly...

20:54.796 --> 20:57.090
where do you
think you're going?

20:58.841 --> 21:01.010
There's nowhere
for you to hide.

21:05.390 --> 21:07.433
Give me your hands.

21:09.352 --> 21:11.270
Don't make me say it twice.

21:16.818 --> 21:19.988
I'm gonna ask you
one last time:

21:21.614 --> 21:23.992
would you like to
accept my bargain?

21:30.540 --> 21:35.837
Precious Blood, Word of God,
You are my eternal salvation.

21:35.920 --> 21:37.922
Lost in sin,
You liberated me.

21:38.006 --> 21:40.091
-You lifted me from perdition...
-You people and your prayers.

21:40.174 --> 21:42.927
Treasuring my feeble soul.

21:43.011 --> 21:44.178
I--
[gasps]

21:46.222 --> 21:47.682
[groaning]

21:47.765 --> 21:49.976
[groans]

21:50.059 --> 21:52.353
[groans]

21:52.437 --> 21:53.855
Aah!

21:58.109 --> 22:00.028
[screams]

22:00.111 --> 22:01.404
[sputtering]

22:10.663 --> 22:11.664
Oh, look.

22:13.499 --> 22:14.333
The sun's back.

22:19.213 --> 22:21.090
Get rid of the body.

22:21.174 --> 22:22.383
How?

22:22.467 --> 22:24.719
That's not my problem.

22:24.802 --> 22:25.928
What happens next?

22:27.513 --> 22:30.641
Now, I light the match,
and I watch it burn.

22:34.270 --> 22:36.230
I'll see you soon, Clara.

22:55.625 --> 22:57.418
You okay, Henry?

22:59.712 --> 23:02.673
It turned dark
in the middle of the day.

23:04.300 --> 23:07.845
Yeah. Uh, that's new.

23:10.890 --> 23:12.683
[gasps]

23:12.767 --> 23:14.018
This can't be real.

23:16.187 --> 23:17.522
How can this be real?

23:17.605 --> 23:20.983
Henry,
I think you need to go down

23:21.067 --> 23:23.111
to the Sheriff's Station,
check on Victor,

23:23.194 --> 23:24.779
make sure he's all right.

23:24.862 --> 23:25.780
Yeah.

23:27.448 --> 23:30.827
I'm just gonna-- uh,

23:30.910 --> 23:33.287
straighten up here
a bit first and...

23:37.458 --> 23:39.377
You want any help?

23:39.460 --> 23:41.129
I...
I think I can manage.

23:41.212 --> 23:43.798
Okay.

23:43.881 --> 23:44.799
Just let me know
if you need anything.

23:44.882 --> 23:45.800
Yeah.

23:49.345 --> 23:50.138
[rattles]

23:51.931 --> 23:53.683
Donna?

23:53.766 --> 23:54.851
Yeah?

23:56.102 --> 23:57.061
[rattles]

24:00.648 --> 24:03.693
Why does Victor
have bullets?

24:03.776 --> 24:07.488
Oh, he used to carry around
a gun in his lunchbox.

24:07.572 --> 24:10.074
Boyd took it away.

24:10.158 --> 24:13.619
And where is it now?

24:13.703 --> 24:15.121
Down at the Sheriff's Station,
I imagine.

24:18.791 --> 24:20.001
[gasps]

24:20.084 --> 24:22.461
Once you accept
that it's a dream,

24:22.545 --> 24:25.506
the dream is gonna provide you
with everything that you need.

24:25.590 --> 24:27.550
[Donna] Henry?

24:27.633 --> 24:28.843
Henry...

24:31.512 --> 24:33.681
...go see your son.

24:33.764 --> 24:35.141
Yeah.

24:35.224 --> 24:36.350
-Okay?
-Yeah, sure.

24:42.982 --> 24:47.737
[ominous music playing]

25:04.128 --> 25:06.422
[Randall]
Where's everybody else?

25:06.505 --> 25:08.466
They went up
to Colony House.

25:08.549 --> 25:10.760
I just came back to make
sure you all got here okay.

25:12.511 --> 25:13.888
What happened?

25:13.971 --> 25:15.223
[sniffs]

25:18.267 --> 25:22.939
Marielle tried to
defend me, but he just...

25:26.525 --> 25:27.360
And then, what?

25:29.278 --> 25:30.863
Fatima?

25:35.451 --> 25:36.994
He left.

25:38.788 --> 25:40.915
He just smiled at me
and he left.

25:40.998 --> 25:42.375
[door opens]

25:47.171 --> 25:48.506
[breathing unsteadily]

25:50.341 --> 25:51.509
You okay?

25:57.390 --> 25:58.391
Where's Kristi?

25:58.474 --> 26:01.435
She-- She's in the, um...

26:07.692 --> 26:09.277
[knocks]

26:09.360 --> 26:11.070
[Boyd] Kristi?

26:11.153 --> 26:12.071
[knocks]

26:14.782 --> 26:17.201
-Kristi?
-[knocks]

26:32.049 --> 26:33.718
I-- I...

26:35.886 --> 26:38.472
[breathing shakily]

26:38.556 --> 26:40.308
I...

26:40.391 --> 26:41.934
Hey, Kristi...

26:42.018 --> 26:43.644
[Kristi sobbing]

26:43.728 --> 26:45.229
[breathing shakily]

26:45.313 --> 26:46.272
Okay, okay.

26:46.355 --> 26:47.315
I don't...

26:47.398 --> 26:49.275
Okay, okay.

26:49.358 --> 26:50.359
[sobbing]

26:50.443 --> 26:51.819
Okay, we'll be okay.

26:51.902 --> 26:54.488
[sobbing]

26:54.572 --> 26:55.740
I'm right here.

26:57.158 --> 26:58.284
I'm right here.

26:59.910 --> 27:02.204
[wailing]

27:02.288 --> 27:04.165
I'm right here.

27:04.248 --> 27:06.584
[wailing]

27:09.628 --> 27:11.464
Okay.

27:11.547 --> 27:13.424
[wailing]

27:15.760 --> 27:18.262
[muffled wailing]

27:33.361 --> 27:34.362
[deafening thunder claps]

27:34.445 --> 27:35.821
Jesus!

27:35.905 --> 27:37.990
[deafening thunder claps]

27:40.159 --> 27:41.869
[thunder continues crashing]

27:56.884 --> 27:58.803
[thunder crashing]

28:11.690 --> 28:16.362
[thunder crashing]

28:16.445 --> 28:19.365
What the fuck did we do?

28:19.448 --> 28:21.075
[thunder continues crashing]

28:23.828 --> 28:25.204
[thunder rumbling]

28:27.498 --> 28:29.291
[car approaching]

28:33.921 --> 28:36.090
They're back!

28:36.173 --> 28:38.509
No, no, no, no, no!
Stay on the porch!

28:54.817 --> 28:56.694
Get her inside.
Where's Tabitha?

28:56.777 --> 28:59.905
We didn't get a signal.
I don't know where they are.

28:59.989 --> 29:01.490
Where's Mom?

29:08.539 --> 29:09.498
[breathing shakily]

29:09.582 --> 29:11.041
Julie?

29:14.545 --> 29:16.380
I don't...

29:18.757 --> 29:21.343
Ethan...
Ethan, please!

29:21.427 --> 29:24.096
[ominous music playing]

29:51.707 --> 29:53.042
Boyd?

29:58.589 --> 29:59.840
Kenny?

30:02.218 --> 30:03.802
Victor?

30:26.534 --> 30:29.703
[breathing unsteadily]

30:36.794 --> 30:38.170
-[door opens]
-[Kenny] Henry.

30:38.254 --> 30:39.421
Hey.

30:39.505 --> 30:40.923
Did you need something?

30:41.006 --> 30:42.800
No, I was just, uh,
looking for Victor.

30:42.883 --> 30:45.928
Did you see the lightning?

30:46.011 --> 30:47.555
Yeah, it was
kinda hard to miss.

30:47.638 --> 30:49.473
I gotta go. Sorry.
Uh, see ya.

30:50.641 --> 30:51.559
[door opens]

31:01.068 --> 31:02.945
She's not
coming back, is she?

31:06.782 --> 31:08.117
Ethan...

31:09.660 --> 31:10.953
your mom and
Jade were still in the--

31:11.036 --> 31:15.040
[slamming]

31:15.124 --> 31:16.792
It's happening again!

31:16.875 --> 31:20.170
[slamming]

31:20.254 --> 31:24.341
[glass shattering]

31:24.425 --> 31:26.719
Ethan... Okay.
Go, go, go, go!

31:26.802 --> 31:27.970
Ethan!

31:28.053 --> 31:29.430
No! Ethan!

31:32.891 --> 31:34.184
Ethan, stop.

31:34.268 --> 31:36.145
No! Mom promised
she'd come back! She promised!

31:36.228 --> 31:37.354
I know. I know.

31:37.438 --> 31:39.481
She said she was
gonna get us home!

31:39.565 --> 31:40.899
And now, she's gone!

31:40.983 --> 31:42.735
And Dad's gone.
And soon you'll be gone!

31:42.818 --> 31:44.820
No, no, no!

31:44.903 --> 31:48.198
Everyone here is gonna die,
and I'm gonna be here alone!

31:48.282 --> 31:49.199
-But I can't--
-No!

31:49.283 --> 31:50.618
I don't want to!

31:50.701 --> 31:52.244
No, you are not
going to be alone!

31:52.328 --> 31:53.829
You will never
be alone, Ethan!

31:53.912 --> 31:55.289
You're lying!
That's what she said!

31:55.372 --> 31:57.124
I can't--

31:57.207 --> 31:59.251
[Julie]
Listen to me. Listen.

31:59.335 --> 32:02.087
We are gonna look out
for each other, okay?

32:02.171 --> 32:04.173
You and me, we're gonna
take care of each other.

32:05.257 --> 32:06.175
How?

32:10.554 --> 32:11.680
I don't know.

32:14.266 --> 32:15.934
But we're gonna
figure it out together.

32:16.018 --> 32:17.561
Okay?

32:19.355 --> 32:21.190
Okay.

32:21.273 --> 32:22.816
Okay. Come here.

32:22.900 --> 32:23.776
[sobbing]

32:41.835 --> 32:42.961
Hey.

32:43.045 --> 32:44.338
Hey.

32:47.841 --> 32:50.260
Not the kind day
we hoped for, was it?

32:50.344 --> 32:51.887
Victor was right.

32:51.970 --> 32:54.807
We never should
have pulled that tree.

32:54.890 --> 32:56.975
What are
we gonna do now?

32:57.059 --> 32:58.227
[Boyd]
I don't know.

32:58.310 --> 32:59.311
Boyd?

33:03.565 --> 33:04.983
We need to go back.

33:05.067 --> 33:06.193
What?

33:06.276 --> 33:07.194
The bones are
still down there.

33:07.277 --> 33:08.529
-Look, we can't--
-No, no, no.

33:08.612 --> 33:09.863
You told people
that those bones

33:09.947 --> 33:12.032
were the key to
getting us outta here.

33:12.116 --> 33:13.534
We can't just stop now.
We have to go back and get them.

33:13.617 --> 33:14.827
And-- And do what?

33:14.910 --> 33:16.245
-Wha--
-Even if we had them,

33:16.328 --> 33:18.372
we don't know how to use them!

33:18.455 --> 33:20.249
The only people who knew
anything about them

33:20.332 --> 33:23.085
went down into those tunnels,
and they didn't come out.

33:23.168 --> 33:25.546
This place got exactly
what it fucking wanted.

33:25.629 --> 33:27.506
Is there any chance
they survived?

33:27.589 --> 33:29.133
How, Kenny?

33:29.216 --> 33:30.759
There's one exit
out of that chamber.

33:30.843 --> 33:33.846
One!
If they were alive--

33:33.929 --> 33:36.432
God damn it!

33:36.515 --> 33:38.100
If they were alive,
they'd be here right now.

33:38.183 --> 33:40.144
No, we can't just give up!

33:40.227 --> 33:42.354
All right, then tell me
how to move forward, okay?

33:42.438 --> 33:45.899
Please. Anybody. Tell me!

33:45.983 --> 33:49.945
We just made
the sun go down!

33:50.028 --> 33:53.782
We fucking tore a hole in
the goddamn sky with lightning!

33:53.866 --> 33:56.076
Who the fuck
even knows what that means!

33:56.160 --> 33:58.078
So, what are
we supposed to do

33:58.162 --> 33:59.371
that could possibly
make anything better?

33:59.455 --> 34:00.581
-[static]
-Boyd--

34:00.664 --> 34:02.207
We lost three people today!
-Boyd--

34:02.291 --> 34:05.127
-I'm not going-- What?!
-Boyd! Stop!

34:05.210 --> 34:06.378
-Listen.
-[static beeping]

34:08.255 --> 34:10.674
[static beeping]

34:10.757 --> 34:11.759
Are you...?

34:11.842 --> 34:13.260
[static beeping]

34:13.342 --> 34:15.344
What the...?

34:15.429 --> 34:16.847
[static beeping]

34:18.639 --> 34:20.809
Shit.
You see that?

34:20.893 --> 34:23.978
[static beeping]

34:24.062 --> 34:25.230
[static continues beeping]

34:25.313 --> 34:26.982
Come on.

34:27.065 --> 34:28.900
[static beeping]

34:28.984 --> 34:30.277
[power cutting out]

34:35.364 --> 34:36.784
Ahh... fuck!

34:38.494 --> 34:40.411
Fuck.

34:40.496 --> 34:42.206
That's it.
The battery's dead.

34:43.831 --> 34:44.875
Do you think
it went through?

34:47.543 --> 34:49.463
Even if it did,
they'd still have to find us.

34:49.545 --> 34:50.630
[exhales]

34:52.882 --> 34:54.760
I'm so sorry.
I never should have--

34:54.842 --> 34:55.928
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

34:56.011 --> 34:57.304
Don't give up,
do you understand?

34:57.387 --> 34:58.388
We're not dying here.

35:05.771 --> 35:07.606
[strains]

35:07.689 --> 35:09.107
[Jade]
It won't break.

35:12.653 --> 35:14.738
But we can dig.

35:14.822 --> 35:16.657
We dig until we get under them.

35:16.740 --> 35:18.116
It's worth a shot.

35:20.202 --> 35:21.537
All right.

35:25.624 --> 35:27.417
What you did
back there,

35:27.501 --> 35:30.295
what you were
willing to do...

35:30.379 --> 35:32.506
I just wanted
to say thank you.

35:32.589 --> 35:35.425
Well, you know
what they say:

35:35.509 --> 35:37.302
women and children first.

35:41.807 --> 35:42.641
You're welcome.

36:02.619 --> 36:03.704
Okay, here we go.

36:06.707 --> 36:08.625
Okay, come on.

36:08.709 --> 36:09.877
Down.
Watch your step.

36:17.968 --> 36:18.760
[Randall]
Easy now.

36:18.844 --> 36:19.845
Yeah.

36:24.600 --> 36:25.642
Okay.

36:25.726 --> 36:27.269
Are you gonna be okay?

36:27.352 --> 36:29.271
Yeah, I'll be fine.

36:29.354 --> 36:31.523
All right. Okay.

36:44.369 --> 36:47.539
I'm gonna head down
with her, to the church.

36:47.623 --> 36:48.749
Anything you need,
do you understand?

36:48.832 --> 36:49.917
Yeah.

37:01.345 --> 37:02.346
Come.

37:02.429 --> 37:03.722
Why?

37:03.805 --> 37:05.349
Come, come.

37:05.432 --> 37:07.059
We got a signal.

37:07.142 --> 37:08.352
-What?
-[Fatima] What?

37:08.435 --> 37:13.273
Yeah, from Tabitha
and Jade's radio.

37:13.357 --> 37:14.733
So, they're alive?

37:14.816 --> 37:16.735
I'm going back to find out.

37:16.818 --> 37:17.819
You're going
to the tunnels.

37:17.903 --> 37:19.655
-Yeah.
-All right, I'm coming with you.

37:19.738 --> 37:21.156
I'm going by myself.

37:21.239 --> 37:23.033
I'm not risking
anybody else's life today.

37:23.116 --> 37:24.534
No, Dad,
what if they're hurt?

37:24.618 --> 37:26.286
I mean, how are you gonna
carry both of them by yourself?

37:26.370 --> 37:28.246
-I'll figure it out.
-Are you sure that signal

37:28.330 --> 37:29.665
even came from Jade and Tabitha?

37:29.748 --> 37:32.125
Exactly, look. I mean, these
things are smart, Dad, okay?

37:32.209 --> 37:34.127
What if they're just trying to
bait you out there?

37:34.211 --> 37:36.254
-I'm going with you.
-We're both going.

37:36.338 --> 37:37.464
All right,
let's just everybody--

37:37.547 --> 37:40.425
No. Boyd, I can feel
them when they're close.

37:40.509 --> 37:42.636
What?

37:42.719 --> 37:44.846
I knew that thing
was coming to the clinic.

37:47.391 --> 37:50.268
I sensed it
before we saw it. If I'm--

37:50.352 --> 37:52.521
if I'm down there with you,
then maybe I can warn you.

37:54.606 --> 37:57.317
[ominous music playing]

38:09.371 --> 38:10.622
Hello?

38:12.082 --> 38:13.834
Is anyone here?

38:16.211 --> 38:19.214
[ominous music playing]

38:41.987 --> 38:44.239
[knocking]

38:44.322 --> 38:46.366
[Victor]
Dad?

38:46.450 --> 38:47.868
Are you in there?

38:47.951 --> 38:48.744
Yeah.

38:54.041 --> 38:56.793
Hey. Today was scary.

38:58.336 --> 38:59.588
Yes.

38:59.671 --> 39:01.173
Nothing like that
ever happened before.

39:03.300 --> 39:05.093
Why are you sitting
in here all alone?

39:10.682 --> 39:12.225
I'm just... thinking.

39:19.900 --> 39:21.651
Did I do
something wrong?

39:23.987 --> 39:24.696
What?

39:32.120 --> 39:34.790
You were different before.
You were happy.

39:36.541 --> 39:39.878
We dragged a bed in here,
so that we could be roommates.

39:39.961 --> 39:41.797
Yeah.

39:41.880 --> 39:45.634
And then, I told you
about the man in yellow.

39:48.178 --> 39:50.305
I showed you
that picture, and I...

39:52.182 --> 39:53.308
I ruined it.

39:53.391 --> 39:54.434
No.

39:55.977 --> 39:59.314
Son, you--
you didn't ruin it.

40:02.025 --> 40:03.527
[exhales]

40:03.610 --> 40:05.445
The problem is...

40:07.280 --> 40:09.866
...it was never real.

40:13.328 --> 40:14.871
Why do you have that?

40:17.791 --> 40:22.546
I've seen what's real,
Victor, and I need to go back.

40:23.755 --> 40:27.884
You begged me to come back.

40:27.968 --> 40:29.469
You have a son.

40:31.054 --> 40:32.973
Victor, you were happy.

40:33.056 --> 40:34.724
Dad...

40:34.808 --> 40:36.518
Dad, something
here's lied to you.

40:36.601 --> 40:38.728
I've been lying to myself.

40:38.812 --> 40:39.813
-Dad!
-All of these years--

40:39.896 --> 40:41.773
-Dad, please!
-It's time to stop.

40:44.234 --> 40:45.318
I'm so sorry.

40:45.402 --> 40:46.403
[Ethan] Victor!

40:47.779 --> 40:49.281
-What?
-No! Run!

40:49.364 --> 40:51.032
[grunting]

40:51.116 --> 40:52.784
Why are you doing this?!

40:52.868 --> 40:54.327
You said that we'd be okay!

40:54.411 --> 40:56.788
You said that you
would protect me!

40:56.872 --> 40:59.583
Why did you
come here and do this?!

40:59.666 --> 41:02.294
-I'm sorr--
-Why?!

41:02.377 --> 41:04.171
Why?!

41:19.811 --> 41:24.566
[ominous music playing]

41:38.872 --> 41:40.540
Did you get them?

41:42.375 --> 41:44.419
[bag clacking]

41:44.502 --> 41:46.338
Good girl.

41:51.051 --> 41:54.512
[ominous music playing]

42:04.522 --> 42:05.440
[Boyd] Okay.

42:06.983 --> 42:08.235
All right.
So, how does this work?

42:08.318 --> 42:09.653
I'm not sure.

42:11.321 --> 42:13.782
It's a little
different every time.

42:13.865 --> 42:15.909
Okay, well, let's just
all stay close together.

42:15.992 --> 42:18.995
If anything goes wrong down
there, anything,

42:19.079 --> 42:22.374
you two run.
You understand me?

42:22.457 --> 42:24.000
No questions, no arguments.

42:24.084 --> 42:25.710
Promise me.

42:25.794 --> 42:27.379
Promise.

42:29.214 --> 42:30.382
You?

42:33.343 --> 42:34.386
Okay.

42:35.637 --> 42:36.805
Hey.

42:37.931 --> 42:38.974
All right.

42:39.057 --> 42:41.643
[exhaling sharply]

42:41.726 --> 42:44.396
[foreboding music playing]

42:49.109 --> 42:51.236
Fuck. We can't do this
with our hands.

42:51.319 --> 42:53.446
We need those
goddamn shovels.

42:53.530 --> 42:56.032
[breathing heavily]
We use the bones.

42:56.116 --> 42:57.575
What?

42:57.659 --> 43:00.870
Yeah, to dig,
we can use the bones.

43:00.954 --> 43:02.539
If we don't move these bars,
we're gonna die here.

43:11.840 --> 43:15.343
[foreboding music playing]

43:25.186 --> 43:26.813
Stop! Stop.

43:32.152 --> 43:34.195
[creature screeching
in distance]

43:48.418 --> 43:50.211
All right. Come on.

44:00.638 --> 44:03.224
It's hard to
believe this is real,

44:05.352 --> 44:07.520
that these bones were
actually children once,

44:07.604 --> 44:09.230
and that we were--

44:09.314 --> 44:10.857
I know, I know. I know.

44:27.290 --> 44:29.834
[mournful music playing]

44:53.274 --> 44:54.734
[gasps]

44:54.818 --> 44:56.569
This was her.

44:58.488 --> 45:00.115
This was her.

45:00.198 --> 45:01.491
This was her!

45:04.160 --> 45:06.079
[creatures screeching
in distance]

45:06.162 --> 45:07.705
Oh, fuck.

45:10.542 --> 45:13.461
[creatures
screeching in distance]

45:15.338 --> 45:17.632
-They know where they are.
-What?

45:17.715 --> 45:20.093
Creatures, they know where
Jade and Tabitha are.

45:20.176 --> 45:21.219
[creatures screeching]

45:21.302 --> 45:23.596
We need to hurry.
Come on.

45:25.140 --> 45:28.226
[creatures
screeching in distance]

45:28.309 --> 45:30.353
Okay, we need to get
the fuck out of here.

45:30.437 --> 45:32.647
No, wait!

45:32.730 --> 45:36.276
[grunts] You fucking
piece of shit! Fuck!

45:36.359 --> 45:38.611
[thudding]

45:38.695 --> 45:39.988
Fuck you! You fucking...

45:40.071 --> 45:41.322
Go, go!

45:41.406 --> 45:42.740
I'm not going to fucking
die down here

45:42.824 --> 45:44.242
for a fucking piece
of shit!

45:44.325 --> 45:45.618
-[Boyd] Jade!
-[Jade] Boyd!

45:45.702 --> 45:47.996
-Hey!
-Boyd! Thank Jesus!

45:48.079 --> 45:49.581
-Oh! Come on.
-[creature screeching]

45:49.664 --> 45:51.875
[Fatima]
They're getting close.

45:51.958 --> 45:54.419
Help me out. Help me.

45:54.502 --> 45:56.171
Come on!

45:56.254 --> 45:58.256
[exertions]

45:58.339 --> 46:01.509
-[creature screeching]
-[Fatima] Boyd!

46:01.593 --> 46:03.052
Hey, go to the back
of the cell.

46:03.136 --> 46:04.471
Move, move.

46:08.433 --> 46:09.601
All right.

46:11.102 --> 46:14.230
[shots firing]

46:14.314 --> 46:15.398
Hey. Okay.
Come on.

46:15.482 --> 46:16.483
[grunting]

46:18.359 --> 46:19.944
-Come on!
-[Tabitha] Here, take it!

46:20.028 --> 46:22.280
Gimme, gimme.
Take the bag.

46:24.365 --> 46:26.367
[Boyd] Easy. Here we go.
There you go.

46:26.451 --> 46:27.452
There you go.

46:27.535 --> 46:29.454
Take this.

46:29.537 --> 46:32.582
[Boyd]
No, easy. Okay. Okay.

46:32.665 --> 46:34.667
Come on, come on.

46:34.751 --> 46:36.002
They're here.

46:36.085 --> 46:37.754
[creatures screeching]

46:37.837 --> 46:39.672
You have to go.

46:39.756 --> 46:42.425
-What?
-[creatures screeching]

46:42.509 --> 46:43.760
I can buy you time.

46:43.843 --> 46:45.762
What the fuck are
you talking about?

46:45.845 --> 46:47.555
Remember who I was.

46:47.639 --> 46:49.474
[creatures screeching]

46:53.144 --> 46:55.563
[snarling]

46:57.815 --> 46:59.025
No.

47:08.326 --> 47:11.746
[screeching]

47:11.829 --> 47:13.331
Go! Go!

47:13.414 --> 47:14.332
Wait! Wait!

47:14.415 --> 47:18.086
[screeching]

47:18.169 --> 47:20.338
No! Dad, no! Please!

47:20.421 --> 47:21.923
[creatures screeching]

47:22.006 --> 47:23.132
Fatima, no!

47:23.216 --> 47:24.676
[screeching]

47:24.759 --> 47:26.386
[screams indistinctly]

47:26.469 --> 47:29.889
[screeching]

47:37.647 --> 47:41.776
Wow, look at you,
all grown up.

47:41.859 --> 47:43.570
They have the bones.

47:43.653 --> 47:47.031
But the Bottle Tree
is gone.

47:47.115 --> 47:48.866
[Boy in White]
You're gonna lose this time.

47:51.995 --> 47:53.705
I've always
admired your optimism.

47:56.916 --> 47:58.042
I guess we'll see.

47:59.877 --> 48:03.673
[pensive music playing]

48:11.222 --> 48:16.019
[theme music plays]
